      "name": "build_observation_pipeline",
      "filePath": "act/ui/observation_pipeline.py",
      "lineRange": [62, 146],
      "summary": "工厂函数，执行纯 RAM 校验（类型、相机键对齐、图像契约）后构建 collector/buffer/adapter 链并创建 ROS 订阅；订阅创建失败时回滚已创建句柄并向上传播异常，绝不返回半建状态。",
      "tags": ["factory", "validation", "fail-fast", "observation"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
